# Server-side proxy for hosts that use _redirects (Cloudflare Pages, Netlify).
# To use: copy this file to frontend/public/_redirects, replace the tunnel host,
# rebuild, and deploy. See docs/REMOTE_TESTING.md.
#
# The 200 status makes the host *proxy* the request instead of redirecting, so
# the browser stays on the static host's origin and cookies remain first-party.
/api/*  https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-TUNNEL.ngrok-free.app/api/:splat  200
/*      /index.html                                                  200
